{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113261","id":3052660004,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc618-Uk","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113261","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113261.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113261.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113261","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113261/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113261/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113261/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4dec66859e98bd8302d621cd65e508b4612eed4d","number":113261,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix miscellaneous oddities around the class reference (part 7)","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Continuation of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107536\r\n\r\nThis PR addressed yet yet another huge chunk of class reference oddities I remembered to note down for later while localizing the class reference. Some of these are clear typos, some are inconsistencies, some are just awkward.\r\n\r\nOf particular note:\r\n- Add tutorial in **WebRTCPeerConnection**\r\n\t- See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109907/files#r2561388386\r\n- Reword some Skeleton3D-related descriptions\r\n- Replace a few occurrences of \"shall\" and \"yield\" with more common alternatives\r\n- Replace nasty `[method duplicate][code](true)[/code]`\r\n- Standardize the descriptions of both `ProjectSettings.gui/common/swap_cancel_ok` and `EditorSettings.interface/editor/accept_dialog_cancel_ok_buttons`\r\n\t- It may seem like the removal of corresponding integers is a notable loss of information, but usage of `DisplayServer.get_swap_cancel_ok` should be encouraged, instead.\r\n- Shift `Dictionary.set`'s description around\r\n\t- Note that this originates from #112261 . If you have suggestions feel free to say\r\n- Consistently refer to the \"file cursor\" as such in **FileAccess**\r\n- Encompass numerical values in `[code]` tags more often\r\n- Mention return value in `ResourceUID.ensure_path`\r\n- Remove unnecessary commas after \"Returns [code]true[/code]\"\r\n- Remove redundant leftover references to enums\r\n\t- Remember https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106159\r\n- Removed redundant warning in **Mutex**\r\n- Fix poor grammar in `ProjectSettings.audio/general/text_to_speech`\r\n- Fix inconsistent common \"Accessibility debugging tools\" note\r\n- Fix entirely incorrect sentence in `Path3D.debug_custom_color`\r\n- Fix `Performance.NAVIGATION_2D/3D_ACTIVE_MAPS` mentioning two maps, leftover from the NavigationServer split\r\n- Fix some missing articles on the way\r\n- Fix \"parameters\" being referred as \"arguments\" in a few places\r\n\r\nFor some of the descriptions affected, additional tweaks have been made to justify a whole translation string change.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues"